ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:start;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">For example:</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\"><strong>\"3 fingers on my hand. 3 fingers in the mirror. Double 3 is 6\"</strong></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Take it in turns to hold up fingers and work out the double.</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 222344837, "text": "A mother and child holding up fingers to a mirror", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 2, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": "Y1 doubling to 10", "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": "Y1 doubling to 10-cnGYeQPBHZqxAw94oW7Qy.png", "linkName": null, "stepType": "IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 222343766, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 222344819, "text": null, "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 1, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regul